No. S 28

CORRIGENDUM

INSURANCE ORDER, 2006 iS 48/2006) In this Order, published in No. 27 of Part II of the Government Gazette dated 20th. March, 2006, the following corrections are made -

(i) in the Arrangement of Sections at page 991, immediately before PART 1, the word "Sections" should read as "Section";

(ii) in section 2 - (a} at page 998, in the definition of "financial year" in the penultimate line, the word "as" which appears for the second time, should read as "a"; (bj at page 1000, in the definition of "written premiums" in the third last line, the word "of" should be inserted immediately after "return";

(iii) at page 1001, in section 3(6) in the third last line, the word "or" which appears for the third time, should read as "of";

(iv) at page 1004, in section 10(l)(b} in the first line, the word "it" is deleted;

(v) at page 1021, in section 31(2) in the fourth line, the word 11providing" should read as "proving";

(vi) at page 1029, in section 46 in the penultimate line, the word "not" which appears for the second time is deleted;

(vii) at page 1033, in section 55(1.) in the third last line, the comma is deleted;

(viii) at page 1034, in section 56{7) in the second line, the word "a" should be inserted immediately before "report";

(ix) at page 1046, in section 69{5) in the second line, the word "life" should be inserted immediately after "or"; 15th. MAY, 2007

(x) at page 1049, in section 71 - (a} in subsection !2) in the last line, the words "to each" which appear for the second time, are deleted; (b} in subsection !3) in the second line, the word "subsections" should read as "subsection";

(c) in subsection !4) in the second line, the word "court" should read as "Court"; (d} in subsection 16) in the first line, the word "insurer" should read as "insurers"; !xi) at page 1050-

(a) in section 71!6) in the last line, the word "insurer" should read as "insurers";

(b) in subsection 7212) in the first line, the word "a" is inserted immediately before "scheme"; !xii) at page 1054, in section 8412) in the last line, the word "of" is inserted immediately after "any"; !xiii) at page 1055, in section 85!1) in the first line, the word "life" is inserted immediately after "any"; !xiv) at page 1058, in the First Schedule -

(a) in PART I, in paragraph 1!2) in the second line, the word "and" should read as "any";

(b) in PART II!i) in paragraph 3, "11)" is inserted immediately before "In" in the first line; Iii) in paragraph 4!2), in the first line the word "in" should read as "In"; !xv) at page 1060, in PART III(a) in paragraph 6!1)(c)!i) in the first line, the word "or" should read as "of";

(b) in paragraph 6!1)(e) in the last line, the word "or" is deleted; {c) in paragraph 6(1)(f7 in the last line, the word "or" is deleted; {d) in paragraph 6(2){b} in the second and last lines, the words "are held by a person acting on behalf of the undertaking" which appear for the second time, are deleted;

(xvi) at page 1062, in paragraph 8(5)(a} in the first line, the word "an" which appears for the second time should read as "any";

(xvii) at page 1063, in paragraph 12{b} in the second line, the word "form" should read as "from";

(xviii) at page 1065, in the Second Schedule in the heading by deleting "PART I" where it appears immediately before "DEFINITION OF INSURANCE TERMS";

(xix) at page 1069, in the Third Schedule, in paragraph 8 in the first line "certificated" should read as "certificate". Dicetak oleh AWANG MOHIDIN BIN HAJl DAUD, Pengarah Percetakan, di Jabatan Percetakan Kerajaan, Bandar Seri Begawan BB3510, Negara Brunei Darussalam. Harga B$5.00
